<h2>08 · Reproduction and references</h2>
<p><code>node scripts/axon-interface/stage2/reproduce.mjs</code> runs the pinned component, native, spatial, surface, induction and cohort studies. Set <code>MRG_PYTHON</code> to the environment installed from the supplied requirements file. The script records dependency versions, source hashes, hardware and elapsed runtime. Failed numerical gates produce a failing release result; software checks cannot make the scientific release green.</p>
